<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-Australia beats South Africa by eight runs.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-Australia beats South Africa by eight runs.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat South Africa by eight runs in their one-day match at the Wanderers on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 258-7 (Michael DiVenuto 89), South Africa 250-8.</p>
</text>
